what other uses can be made of this chip.

00:07:45.919 --> 00:07:48.765
All of a sudden I'm doing this because
somebody else is controlling me.

00:07:49.065 --> 00:07:51.854
Uh, I kind of don't like that.

00:07:52.275 --> 00:07:56.325
And I'm a little, I have to be very
